    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR refactors webhook-triggering behavior into a reusable concern and introduces a dedicated STI hierarchy/table for notarial (envelope) events, moving them out of the generic `Event` STI used for document events.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `HookTriggable` concern to centralize delegation + `after_create_commit` webhook enqueueing logic.\n- Refactored `Event` and `AcceptanceTerm::Event` to use `hook_triggable` instead of duplicated callback/trigger code.\n- Introduced `Notarial::Event` (STI) with new `notarial_events` table plus initial subclasses/specs; removed old document-activation event subclasses from `Event`.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 15 out of 15 changed files in this pull request and generated 6 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| app/models/concerns/hook_triggable.rb | New concern encapsulating webhook trigger/enqueue logic. |\r\n| app/models/event.rb | Replaces inline webhook trigger code with `HookTriggable`; removes doc activation subclasses from `SUBCLASSES`. |\r\n| app/models/acceptance_term/event.rb | Switches to `HookTriggable` and keeps passing STI class name to `HookWorker`. |\r\n| app/models/notarial/event.rb | New base model for notarial events (STI) with webhook trigger configuration. |\r\n| app/models/notarial/event/envelope_activated.rb | New notarial event subclass intended to represent envelope activation success. |\r\n| app/models/notarial/event/envelope_activation_failed.rb | New notarial event subclass intended to represent envelope activation failure. |\r\n| app/models/event/document_activated.rb | Deleted (moved conceptually to notarial event space). |\r\n| app/models/event/document_activation_failed.rb | Deleted (moved conceptually to notarial event space). |\r\n| db/migrate/20260324193138_create_notarial_events.rb | Creates `notarial_events` table for new STI hierarchy. |\r\n| db/schema.rb | Schema updated for `notarial_events` table + FK. |\r\n| spec/models/concerns/hook_triggable_spec.rb | New specs covering enqueue behavior when the concern is included. |\r\n| spec/models/notarial/event_spec.rb | New specs for notarial event base behavior (name/payload/delegation). |\r\n| spec/models/notarial/event/envelope_activated_spec.rb | Updated to validate notarial envelope-activated event data. |\r\n| spec/models/notarial/event/envelope_activation_failed_spec.rb | Updated to validate notarial envelope-activation-failed event data. |\r\n| spec/factories/notarial/events.rb | Factory for `Notarial::Event` (STI). |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/clicksign/tavola/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
